11
01:01:56,842 --> 01:02:02,842
It stars an ensemble cast consisting of Ralph Fiennes, Anya Taylor-Joy, Nicholas
Hoult, Hong Chau, Janet McTeer, Judith Light, and John Leguizamo.

12
01:07:34,736 --> 01:07:40,736
It follows a foodie and his date travelling to a remote island to eat at an exclusive restaurant where
the chef has prepared a lavish menu but reveals shocking surprises throughout the meal.

13
01:13:12,631 --> 01:13:18,631
The film had its world premiere at the 47th Toronto International Film Festival on September 10, 2022, and
was theatrically released in the United States on November 18, 2022, by Searchlight Pictures.

14
01:18:50,526 --> 01:18:56,526
It grossed $79.6 million worldwide and received positive reviews from critics.

15
01:24:28,421 --> 01:24:34,421
At the 80th Golden Globe Awards, Fiennes and Taylor-Joy were nominated for
Best Actor and Best Actress – Musical or Comedy, respectively.

16
01:30:06,315 --> 01:30:12,315
The film earned five nominations, including Best
Thriller Film, at the 51st Saturn Awards.

17
01:35:44,210 --> 01:35:50,210
The film explores themes of psychopath, obsession,
mass murder, restaurant, dark comedy.

18
01:41:22,105 --> 01:41:28,105
The tone is lighthearted and dark and intense.
